tran_rc_pulse: the transient of an RC low-pass (tau 1 ns) under a pulse source
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
load "spice/capacitor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
model capacitor sp_capacitor
v1 (in 0) vsource type="pulse" val0=0.0 val1=1.0 delay=1n rise=1n fall=1n width=5n period=20n
r1 (in out) resistor r=1k
c1 (out 0) capacitor c=1p
control
  analysis tran1 tran stop=40n step=0.1n maxstep=0.1n
endc
